Package: somasave-client
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: curl, dpkg, systemd, debconf (>= 0.5), apt
Maintainer: Jumbostar Solutions Limited <support@jumbostar.co.ke>
Description: StudentPocket API installer and manager
 Provides the somasave command-line tool to install, update,
 and manage the StudentPocket API server on Debian/Ubuntu systems.
 .
 After installing this package, run:
   sudo somasave install
 to download and configure the StudentPocket API.
Homepage: https://jumbostar.co.ke
